OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as woman fined #500 for
OL,4,Adog microchip error
OL,5,
OL,6,FDog owners are being urged to ensure
OL,7,Ftheir pet's microchip information is
OL,8,Fupdated after a woman was prosecuted
OL,9,Fand fined more than #500.
OL,11,FWiltshire Council dog warden Seb
OL,12,FWilliams said that all dogs should
OL,13,Flegally be microchipped from eight
OL,14,Fweeks of age and the details on that
OL,15,Fchip kept up-to-date.
OL,17,FThe council said it received 659 calls
OL,18,Fabout lost or found dogs during 2025/26
OL,19,Fand 190 of those had to be taken to
OL,20,Fkennels as the owners could not be
OL,21,Fimmediately found - only 17 had updated
OL,22,Fmicrochip details.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
